sequenceDiagram
  actor Person
  participant UI as RENTipid sign-in
  participant Provider as External provider
  participant Auth as UnifiedAuthService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Person->>UI: Choose enabled method and accept terms
  UI->>Provider: Authenticate
  Provider-->>UI: Verified provider identity
  UI->>Auth: provider + subject + profile metadata
  Auth->>DB: Find provider identity
  DB-->>Auth: Not found
  Auth->>DB: Check possible canonical email match
  DB-->>Auth: No existing account
  Auth->>DB: Create User and AuthProviderIdentity
  Auth-->>UI: Canonical User
  UI->>DB: Register UserSession
  UI-->>Person: Continue to RENTipid
